   "lines": [
    "Our great, midyear",
    "Porc. supper came off",
    "today. Besides the ~~28~~ ^18^",
    "immediates about 40",
    "honoraries attended. All",
    "the older men had",
    "known Father either",
    "personally or by repu-",
    "tation, and I had",
    "very pleasant talks",
    "with them. How I",
    "wish I could ever",
    "do something to keep",
    "up his name!",
    "George Upham came",
    "into the club - the other",
    "Sophmores are Sam",
    "Hammond Chas[?] Dick Sprague",
    "& Billy Peters."
   ],
